						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div class="content-panel centered standalone"> <p><span style="font-size:120%;">我们现在有了自己的<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/system:page-tags/tag/mobile-site-cn#pages">站点标签</a>，请写作有关Mobile-Site-CN文档的作者为自己的文档加上Mobile-Site-CN标签。</span></p> </div> <div style="center no-repeat ; float: center; border: solid 2px #000000; padding: 1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <div style="text-align: center;"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/mobile-site-cn/Mobile_Site_Logo" width="200px" alt="Mobile_Site_Logo" class="image" /> <h1><span>SCP基金会中国分部流动者站点</span></h1> <p><strong>官方名称：</strong>SCP基金会流动者研究与收容设施</p> <p><strong>站点识别码：</strong>Mobile-Site-CN</p> </div> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>基本信息</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <div id="wiki-tabview-ec5521fc8511510777d556febe8035a8" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>简介</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>人员信息</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>相关项目</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>相关外围</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>机动特遣队</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>简介</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/mobile-site-cn/Mobile_Site_Entrance"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/mobile-site-cn/Mobile_Site_Entrance/medium.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="Mobile_Site_Entrance" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>流动者站点的入口处，被人造雪隐藏。</p> </div> </div> <p><strong>建立时间：</strong>19██年██月██日</p> <p><strong>创始主管：</strong>Andrew Boom主管</p> <p><strong>位置：</strong>中国[已编辑]省[已编辑]市地下</p> <p><strong>掩盖设施：</strong>防空洞遗址</p> <p><strong>站点职务：</strong>为各站点提供进行收容工作的研究员与特工，研究，收容，特遣队部署，与文案整理。</p> <p><strong>面积：</strong>占地28.5万平方米</p> <p><strong>内部分区：</strong></p> <p>    <strong>行政区：</strong>资料管理室，人员<br />         派遣联系间，主管<br />         办公室，行政接待<br />         处</p> <p>    <strong>A区：</strong>员工宿舍间，员工休息<br />        室，健身室，食堂</p> <p>    <strong>B区：</strong>员工办公室，医疗中心</p> <p>    <strong>C区：</strong>非异常物资存放区</p> <p>    <strong>D区：</strong>特遣队驻扎区</p> <p>    <strong>E区：</strong>项目收容区①（低收容难度）</p> <p>    <strong>F区：</strong>项目收容区②（较高收容难度）</p> <p>    <strong>G区：</strong>机舱区</p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>人员信息</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <p><strong>站点主管：</strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/boom-personnel-file">Andrew Boom</a> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/andrew-boom" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2787384&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609918725" alt="Andrew Boom" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2787384)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/andrew-boom" >Andrew Boom</a></span></p> <p><strong>驻站研究员：</strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/idokoe-s-personnel-file">Delta Cage</a> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/idokoe" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3397390&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609918725" alt="Idokoe" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3397390)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/idokoe" >Idokoe</a></span></p> <p><strong>驻站研究员：</strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/nanlihua-s-personal-file">Nan Lihua</a> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nan-lihua" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5030447&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609918725" alt="Nan Lihua" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php